JavaScript GIF parser and player bookmarklet. See <http://slbkbs.org/jsgif>.

## Build

Use podman to build on an image with the build toolchain.

### Make image

```
podman build -t jsgif-build -f Containerfile .
```

### Run build in image

```
podman run --rm -v "$PWD":/src:Z jsgif-build > bookmarklet.txt
```

### Make bookmarklet

Successful output will be in bookmarklet.txt. Copy and paste it into a new browser bookmark in the url/location field.
